cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "HEAL-ViT: A 48-layer HEALPix Shifted-Window Transformer for Global Weather Forecasting"
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bharat
    email: bharatscience111@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/yellowbanana-dev/Heal_ViT-48-layers"
abstract: >-
  A data-driven global weather model combining an equal-area HEALPix icosahedral
  mesh with a 48-layer shifted-window vision transformer and graph neural network
  encoder/decoder. Trained on 40 years of ERA5 (1979-2018) at 6-hourly, 121x240
  resolution over 20 atmospheric variables, with autoregressive rollout
  fine-tuning. Retains skill (ACC > 0.6) to 7.5 days for 500 hPa geopotential and
  remains spectrally stable through a 15-day rollout.
keywords:
  - weather forecasting
  - vision transformer
  - graph neural network
  - HEALPix
  - ERA5
  - WeatherBench 2
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-11"
